<Guide
  title="California QSBS: Taxes, Residency, and Moving"
  description="Does California tax QSBS gains? Understand federal versus state treatment, moving before a stock sale, residency, and employee equity sourcing."
  heading="California QSBS: state taxes, residency, and moving before an exit"
